Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:50:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] mqtt: discover a rotary encoder as a Home Assistant
 event entity

A knob's detents are events, not held state, so they cannot ride the retained
state/buttons/* levels. Boards that report hasEncoder() publish each detent as
a non-retained "cw" / "ccw" on <P>/state/knob, and discovery adds a "Knob"
event entity for it. The default is false, so other boards announce the same
document as before.

