+### state/knob
+
+Only boards with a rotary encoder publish this. A detent is an event rather than
+a level, so every detent is its own message, `cw` or `ccw`. The message is **not
+retained**, which means a reconnect never replays an old turn. `cw` is the
+direction that moves to the next app, and the board's rotation and button-swap
+settings apply to it the same way. A turn is published even while navigation is
+blocked or a script takes the detent.
+
+```bash
+mosquitto_sub -h broker.local -t 'awtrixNG/state/knob' -v
+```
+
